174 17-72-802. Prohibition on providing copy of booking photograph -- Statement required --
Victim access -- Criminal liability for false statement -- Remedy for failure to remove or delete.
178 (1) As used in this section:
179 (a) "Booking photograph" means a photograph or image of an individual that is generated:
181 (i) for identification purposes; and
