213 (4)
(a) Except as provided in Subsection (5), a publish-for-pay publication or a publish-for-pay website
shall remove and destroy a booking photograph of an individual who submits a request for removal
and destruction within 30 calendar days after the day on which the individual makes the request.
217 (b) A publish-for-pay publication or publish-for-pay website described in Subsection (4)(a) may not
